# US tech job postings (daily)

Open jobs at {{ companies | num }} US tech companies, collected every day from their public Greenhouse, Lever and Ashby job boards by the open-source pipeline [{{ cfg.public_repo }}](https://github.com/{{ cfg.public_repo }}). The latest run, on {{ run_date }}, listed {{ open_jobs | num }} open postings.

## Dataset summary

- **One row per job posting ever seen.** Each row has the current attributes of the posting (title, role family, seniority, location, remote type, salary range), its lifecycle (first seen, last seen, closed on, days open) and a link to the original posting.
- **Files:** one Parquet file per month, `data/job_postings_YYYY-MM.parquet`, containing every posting seen during that month. It is refreshed every day of the month.
- **Coverage:** {{ by_provider.greenhouse | num }} companies on Greenhouse, {{ by_provider.ashby | num }} on Ashby and {{ by_provider.lever | num }} on Lever. How they were chosen is in [docs/sources.md](https://github.com/{{ cfg.public_repo }}/blob/{{ cfg.branch }}/docs/sources.md).

